the target language is: prolog.

the knowledge base finishedby includes these resources:
    lomo.

the knowledge base finishedby includes:

the text of the source description is at "sources/finishedBy.ttl".

% Who bears a duty: the agent of this role of the action (lomo.le).
the bearer role is addresser.


deadline submit report is identified by "http://example.org/Deadline_SubmitReport".

deadline submit report is a temporal specification.

deadline submit report has the instant 2025-12-31.

deadline submit report has the function deadline.

deadline submit report is finished by fiscal year 2025.


fiscal year 2025 is identified by "http://example.org/FiscalYear2025".

fiscal year 2025 is a temporal specification.

fiscal year 2025 has the instant 2025-12-31.

fiscal year 2025 has the label "End of Fiscal Year 2025".


action submit report is identified by "http://example.org/Action_SubmitReport".

action submit report is an action.

action submit report has the time specification action submit report time.


action submit report time is a temporal specification.

action submit report time is finished by action review report.


action review report is identified by "http://example.org/Action_ReviewReport".

action review report is an action.

action review report has the time specification action review report time.


action review report time is a temporal specification.

action review report time has the instant 2025-12-31.


% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario calendar is, as stated in the source description:
    % A case for the calendar: the events that a deadline counts from, and the rhythms that
    % count from nothing else, start on 2027-01-01.
    the calendar starts on 2027-01-01.
    due_dates expects answers [].
    due_in_2027 expects answers [].

scenario the_links is, as stated in the source description:
    times_within expects answers ["fiscal year 2025 is during deadline submit report", "action review report is during action submit report time"].
    broken_links expects answers [].

query deadlines is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as deadline.

query due_dates is:
    which agent has which action due on which date.

query due_in_2027 is:
    which agent has which action due on which date in the period from 2027-01-01 to 2027-12-31.

query must_perform is:
    which party must perform which action by which date under which rule.

query must_perform_by_the_moment is:
    which party must perform which action by the moment which moment under which rule.

query met_in_time is:
    which party met which action in time under which rule.

query applies is:
    which rule applies to which party.

query rules_without_conditions is:
    which rule has no written conditions.

query kinds is:
    which thing is of the kind which kind.

query prescriptive is:
    which thing is a prescriptive rule.

query constitutive is:
    which thing is a constitutive rule.

query starting_points is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as starting point.

query validity is:
    which thing has which temporal specification as validity.

query instants is:
    which temporal specification has the instant which date.

query first_dates is:
    the first date of which temporal specification is which date.

query last_dates is:
    the last date of which temporal specification is which date.

query later_times is:
    which temporal specification is later than which second temporal specification.

query times_within is:
    which temporal specification is during which second temporal specification.

query broken_links is:
    which temporal specification breaks its link with which second temporal specification.

query parts is:
    which thing is part of the description.

query texts is:
    which thing is described by the text which text.

query addresses is:
    which thing is identified by which address.

query bearer is:
    the bearer role is which role.

